#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapistructframediff.rst:95
msgid ""
"Provides a way to explicitly dispose of memory associated with this "
"framediff data structure instead of waiting for the Lua garbage collector to"
" dispose of that memory. **Warning:** Errors are likely to result from using"
" a framediff after calling dispose on it, it's highly recommended that you "
"not do so."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona una forma de liberar explícitamente la memoria asociada con esta"
" estructura de datos framediff en lugar de esperar a que el recolector de "
"basura de Lua libere esa memoria. **Advertencia:** Es probable que se "
"produzcan errores al usar un framediff después de llamar a dispose sobre él;"
" se recomienda encarecidamente que no lo haga."

